WEBVTT

01:13.050 --> 01:18.790
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.130 --> 01:24.150
[Episode 34]

01:26.293 --> 01:30.133
You knew all about it.

01:58.903 --> 02:02.773
I used to be a live streamer,

02:04.423 --> 02:05.583
a singing streamer,

02:06.573 --> 02:08.423
who loved to cover

02:09.223 --> 02:11.053
classic old songs of Hong Kong and Taiwan.

02:13.143 --> 02:14.743
You're good at singing.

02:19.943 --> 02:21.813
So it was my birthday

02:22.293 --> 02:25.172
when I decided to donate

02:25.173 --> 02:26.613
all the proceeds of my live streaming

02:26.983 --> 02:28.773
to a fan who was sick

02:29.223 --> 02:31.373
but was too poor to see a doctor.

02:32.383 --> 02:33.583
Because it was my birthday,

02:33.893 --> 02:36.493
the earnings were higher than usual,

02:37.263 --> 02:39.893
about 30,000 yuan.

02:40.383 --> 02:43.373
I added some money of my
own and got 50,000 in total

02:43.573 --> 02:45.303
to donate to the fan.

02:47.543 --> 02:50.543
Later,
when the amount of donation was announced,

02:51.733 --> 02:53.183
someone said that

02:53.943 --> 02:56.023
the amount I donated was too small

02:56.383 --> 02:57.612
and that the proceeds that day

02:57.613 --> 02:59.183
must have been more than 30,000.

03:00.053 --> 03:03.263
I explained that I had to share
the money with the platform

03:04.613 --> 03:08.893
but no one believed me.

03:10.863 --> 03:13.423
Then everyone started to scold me desperately.

03:15.103 --> 03:16.183
After that,

03:17.013 --> 03:18.942
The platform issued a certificate

03:18.943 --> 03:20.142
proving that the earnings that day

03:20.143 --> 03:21.893
were indeed around 30,000.

03:22.573 --> 03:27.263
I thought it would be fine
if I could explain it clearly.

03:29.943 --> 03:31.933
But some people were even more irritated,

03:32.703 --> 03:37.142
starting to dig into what brands of clothes

03:37.143 --> 03:38.983
and jewelry I wore in the past,

03:40.013 --> 03:43.012
and saying that the
amount of money I donated

03:43.013 --> 03:44.303
is merely the price of one of my clothes.

03:44.703 --> 03:45.813
They said

03:48.263 --> 03:50.743
I spent this small amount of money

03:51.703 --> 03:55.023
to build a public persona
as a kind-hearted person.

03:58.293 --> 04:00.093
And what's more ridiculous,

04:02.103 --> 04:06.423
a person who claimed to be my classmate

04:07.173 --> 04:08.493
stepped forward to spill the tea

04:12.583 --> 04:18.423
that I kept dating rich
boyfriends when I was in school.

04:19.983 --> 04:21.013
What followed was

04:23.373 --> 04:27.343
my phone number and address

04:28.293 --> 04:30.013
being exposed to all.

04:33.733 --> 04:35.493
At that time,

04:37.903 --> 04:39.662
people called me every day to harass me,

04:39.663 --> 04:40.663
and rang the intercom

04:41.543 --> 04:44.543
attached to
the access control system downstairs.

04:54.373 --> 04:55.423
Then the rumors

04:56.343 --> 04:58.453
became more and more disgusting.

05:00.293 --> 05:02.453
I didn't know what to do at that time.

05:03.493 --> 05:05.183
I wanted to explain

05:06.053 --> 05:08.253
but I didn't know how to explain,

05:09.173 --> 05:11.902
because those people only believed

05:11.903 --> 05:13.743
what they wanted to believe.

05:15.493 --> 05:16.783
During that time,

05:17.223 --> 05:22.223
even my colleagues and peers
also began to hide from me.

05:25.903 --> 05:28.053
You must have suffered a lot of grievances.

05:30.423 --> 05:31.783
You must have been scared.

05:34.223 --> 05:36.103
During those days, I thought to myself

05:39.103 --> 05:40.983
that it had been so long

05:42.173 --> 05:44.303
and I should be able to get over it.

05:45.493 --> 05:47.223
But when I realized

05:48.463 --> 05:50.253
that I was recognized by them again,

05:51.583 --> 05:56.103
and those eyes gathered on me again...

05:58.783 --> 05:59.903
Hongdou,

06:02.343 --> 06:04.053
I'm not that brave.

06:06.223 --> 06:07.573
People sometimes

06:07.783 --> 06:09.453
will encounter something.

06:10.373 --> 06:11.373
However,

06:12.053 --> 06:14.373
it's just like when people suddenly get sick,

06:15.253 --> 06:17.013
It's not their fault.

06:34.983 --> 06:36.983
Cuo Bazi, slow down!

06:41.053 --> 06:42.223
Run slowly.

06:44.423 --> 06:46.693
Don't run too fast. Slow down!

07:04.423 --> 07:06.223
What brings you here?

07:14.613 --> 07:16.932
She hasn't eaten properly for days.

07:16.933 --> 07:18.493
She was busy in the past few days,

07:18.693 --> 07:20.052
so she had to cram food down her throat.

07:20.053 --> 07:23.013
And she's been in a bad mood
recently and hasn't eaten much.

07:24.543 --> 07:26.102
You needn't worry about me.

07:26.103 --> 07:27.693
I am eating right now.

07:31.173 --> 07:32.812
Damai, Now that you're back,

07:32.813 --> 07:34.132
you need to keep an eye on her for me

07:34.133 --> 07:35.342
and make sure she finishes her food.

07:35.343 --> 07:36.783
No problem. Leave it to me.

07:38.053 --> 07:39.422
Don't be so exaggerated.

07:39.423 --> 07:40.782
I'm fine.

07:40.783 --> 07:42.102
You're just not thinking about it right now,

07:42.103 --> 07:43.252
so you feel everything is alright.

07:43.253 --> 07:44.222
If we leave you alone,

07:44.223 --> 07:45.493
what shall we do if something happens to you?

07:46.583 --> 07:48.732
You really don't have to
worry about me all the time.

07:48.733 --> 07:50.183
I'm fine, really.

07:50.903 --> 07:53.053
Haven't I made it through this?

07:53.733 --> 07:56.252
And you have your own things to do.

07:56.253 --> 07:59.743
I can't help you,
but I can't keep giving you trouble.

08:01.583 --> 08:03.933
But a friend is to give you a
hand when you're in trouble.

08:04.293 --> 08:07.103
But no one will want to
give a stranger trouble.

08:07.863 --> 08:10.582
Just chill out
during these days.

08:10.583 --> 08:12.662
Stay at home with Damai.

08:12.663 --> 08:13.542
Don't think about anything.

08:13.543 --> 08:14.543
Alright.

08:17.343 --> 08:18.343
Eat.

08:21.733 --> 08:23.693
Why did you bring Cuo Bazi back?

08:26.223 --> 08:28.252
And Nana likes Cuo Bazi.

08:28.253 --> 08:31.102
Besides, dogs feel restrained in cities

08:31.103 --> 08:32.342
because they can't run around freely.

08:32.343 --> 08:33.862
If I give the dog to my parents,

08:33.863 --> 08:36.062
I'm afraid they can't
drag it when they walk it.

08:36.063 --> 08:37.503
So, I brought it here.

08:39.303 --> 08:40.532
Whose dog is this?

08:40.533 --> 08:41.733
It's so adorable.

08:42.733 --> 08:44.263
Mr. Ma.

08:44.773 --> 08:45.973
Mr. Ma.

08:49.253 --> 08:50.623
Damai.

08:51.223 --> 08:51.983
When did you get back?

08:51.984 --> 08:53.423
I just arrived.

08:55.133 --> 08:56.133
You look slimmer.

08:56.463 --> 08:57.973
I've put on 2.5 kilograms.

08:59.063 --> 09:00.933
Mr. Ma. Why did you come back suddenly?

09:01.373 --> 09:04.862
I went on a field trip to
the Crimson Roses Farm.

09:04.863 --> 09:06.453
So I decided to visit you guys.

09:09.823 --> 09:10.823
Nana,

09:12.373 --> 09:13.383
how're you doing?

09:15.613 --> 09:16.532
Good.

09:16.533 --> 09:17.663
Don't worry about me.

09:19.133 --> 09:20.133
That's great.

09:21.183 --> 09:23.973
Since Damai also came back,
you two can hang out together.

09:24.863 --> 09:26.412
I'll go back to my room to tidy up my stuff.

09:26.413 --> 09:27.612
Let's have tea in the yard later.

09:27.613 --> 09:28.253
Sure.

09:28.254 --> 09:29.252
Mr. Ma.

09:29.253 --> 09:30.253
Mr. Ma.

09:31.463 --> 09:32.652
What a fat doggy.

09:32.653 --> 09:34.492
Look how round you are!

09:34.493 --> 09:35.772
Hey, what's going on?

09:35.773 --> 09:36.612
Didn't I tell you

09:36.613 --> 09:37.732
I'll pick you up at the entrance of the alley?

09:37.733 --> 09:38.732
Why did you come here on your own?

09:38.733 --> 09:39.942
You should have let me pick you up.

09:39.943 --> 09:41.462
We're not pupils who need to go to the bathroom

09:41.463 --> 09:42.463
hand in hand.

09:42.893 --> 09:43.982
Mai!

09:43.983 --> 09:45.412
I missed you so much!

09:45.413 --> 09:46.492
Come here.

09:46.493 --> 09:47.853
Give me a hug.

09:50.373 --> 09:51.373
You've gained some weight.

09:53.733 --> 09:55.492
Do you miss me?

09:55.493 --> 09:56.223
No.

09:56.224 --> 09:57.302
I'll go unpack my luggage.

09:57.303 --> 09:58.303
Wait!

09:58.533 --> 09:59.372
I need to say something to you.

09:59.373 --> 10:00.373
What?

10:00.893 --> 10:02.942
You're a boss now.

10:02.943 --> 10:04.693
Shouldn't you treat us to dinner?

10:05.943 --> 10:06.943
Hu,

10:07.703 --> 10:09.973
I heard that you're dating.

10:10.583 --> 10:12.222
What're you talking about?

10:12.223 --> 10:12.893
I don't get it.

10:12.894 --> 10:15.182
Well, I'll help him unpack his luggage.

10:15.183 --> 10:15.893
No rush.

10:15.893 --> 10:16.839
It's fine.

10:16.863 --> 10:18.623
Tell me the details first.

10:18.823 --> 10:20.062
Are the details something you should know?

10:20.063 --> 10:22.213
I have to know so that I
can give you some advice.

10:22.943 --> 10:23.612
How's that?

10:23.613 --> 10:25.023
Why is it so heavy?

10:25.413 --> 10:26.903
Do you have a picture? Let me see.

10:28.983 --> 10:30.813
Have some corn!

10:37.493 --> 10:40.462
If you guys have any favorite songs,

10:40.463 --> 10:42.252
you can share them with me.

10:42.253 --> 10:44.973
After I learn them, I'll cover them for you.

10:45.303 --> 10:46.862
If you have any songs that you wanna listen to,

10:46.863 --> 10:49.023
you can leave comments on the bullet screen.

10:50.063 --> 10:51.663
All I Want Is To Be Here With You

10:53.463 --> 10:56.412
How old are you to know this song?

10:56.413 --> 10:58.183
Are you testing me?

10:59.373 --> 11:01.853
The song was dropped before I was born.

11:09.413 --> 11:11.182
Thank you, everyone.

11:11.183 --> 11:13.423
Thank you for supporting me.

11:16.703 --> 11:17.733
Eat.

11:18.463 --> 11:19.933
Ukulele.

11:20.463 --> 11:21.652
I was practicing it.

11:21.653 --> 11:24.573
When I'm done practicing,
I'll be able to play it for you.

11:27.373 --> 11:28.373
Got it.

11:28.983 --> 11:30.892
The next song All I Want Is To Be Here With You.

11:30.893 --> 11:33.772
If you like it, you can search for it online.

11:33.773 --> 11:35.093
The song is for you.

11:37.253 --> 11:38.253
Who's calling?

11:41.343 --> 11:42.733
Probably a harassment call again.

11:43.653 --> 11:44.693
Don't answer.

11:46.943 --> 11:47.943
Hello?

11:48.493 --> 11:50.582
You just say who you are and what you want.

11:50.583 --> 11:51.813
Just hang up!

11:52.653 --> 11:53.663
A fan.

11:55.343 --> 11:57.183
Well, she's alright.

11:57.533 --> 11:59.623
How did you get this phone number?

12:02.703 --> 12:03.342
Okay.

12:03.343 --> 12:04.063
I'll tell her.

12:04.063 --> 12:04.653
Don't worry.

12:04.654 --> 12:06.093
We are all Nana's friends.

12:07.133 --> 12:08.133
Sure. Bye.

12:09.653 --> 12:10.813
A fan?

12:11.063 --> 12:12.813
He said he support Nana.

12:14.063 --> 12:15.423
He said Nana didn't do anything wrong.

12:15.613 --> 12:17.453
He wished her to return to normal life sooner.

12:19.373 --> 12:22.143
Did he just say how he knew my phone number?

12:22.373 --> 12:24.702
Everyone can get the WeChat
account you left in the store

12:24.703 --> 12:25.702
is your phone number as well.

12:25.703 --> 12:26.703
Change it.

12:27.253 --> 12:28.933
No wonder

12:30.583 --> 12:31.652
I've received several harassment calls recently

12:31.653 --> 12:32.732
which made my blood pressure go up.

12:32.733 --> 12:34.732
How did Nana go through all of this?

12:34.733 --> 12:36.623
What happened to Nana?

12:37.823 --> 12:39.582
Nothing. She's fine.

12:39.583 --> 12:40.693
Just eat your food.

12:40.893 --> 12:41.799
Here.

12:41.823 --> 12:43.383
Have another spoon.

12:44.253 --> 12:45.693
Eat more.

12:51.103 --> 12:52.453
Just eat.

12:55.863 --> 12:56.942
You just throw it directly.

12:56.943 --> 12:58.062
Aren't you afraid that it will pop?

12:58.063 --> 12:59.213
I won't.

13:00.343 --> 13:02.143
Why are you so timid?

13:02.863 --> 13:04.383
I'm afraid that you get hurt.

13:06.943 --> 13:08.023
Look at them.

13:08.463 --> 13:09.412
I can't put up with them anymore.

13:09.413 --> 13:10.783
Calm down.

13:11.223 --> 13:12.612
Even if you have
never experienced love yourself,

13:12.613 --> 13:14.303
you must have seen it before.

13:14.773 --> 13:16.342
Who hasn't experienced love?

13:16.343 --> 13:18.453
I've experienced enough!

13:19.133 --> 13:21.093
I was talking about true love,

13:22.823 --> 13:24.693
not the kind of

13:25.343 --> 13:28.023
love affair you're talking
about that ends before it grows.

13:28.583 --> 13:31.222
No matter how long they are in love,
it's still true love.

13:31.223 --> 13:33.862
The love which ends before
it grows is also true love.

13:33.863 --> 13:35.783
Why does my love not count?

13:37.343 --> 13:38.343
Nonsense.

13:39.463 --> 13:40.973
Love

13:42.183 --> 13:45.143
is a mutual attraction between two souls.

13:46.533 --> 13:48.182
The so-called love at first sight

13:48.183 --> 13:50.503
is merely the lust for good looks.

13:51.653 --> 13:53.772
People like you who are
looking for a date in the bar

13:53.773 --> 13:56.213
even don't have the requirements
for appearance.

13:57.863 --> 14:00.182
When the light goes off
and the alcohol goes up,

14:00.183 --> 14:01.543
you tangle all night long.

14:01.823 --> 14:06.213
When you wake up the next day,
What is left are the ashes

14:06.733 --> 14:07.813
after the burning of carnal desire.

14:08.373 --> 14:09.492
I'll tell you what.

14:09.493 --> 14:11.213
You are biased against me.

14:11.413 --> 14:12.543
I'm not biased.

14:12.773 --> 14:14.093
I am summarizing.

14:15.983 --> 14:17.062
Bullshit.

14:17.063 --> 14:18.693
You've summarized my love as ashes.

14:19.703 --> 14:20.532
It's so late.

14:20.533 --> 14:22.303
Why isn't Manjun back yet?

14:22.493 --> 14:24.102
She... She rented a car

14:24.103 --> 14:25.862
and drove to Kunming
to chill out with her friends.

14:25.863 --> 14:27.213
She's not here.

14:27.893 --> 14:29.143
She went to Kunming?

14:30.303 --> 14:31.503
She didn't tell you?

14:33.253 --> 14:34.453
No, she didn't.

14:35.103 --> 14:37.612
We're just neighbors
living next door.

14:37.613 --> 14:38.892
She doesn't need to tell me.

14:38.893 --> 14:39.933
She didn't tell me.

14:43.823 --> 14:44.982
Smells good!

14:44.983 --> 14:46.053
We can eat now.

14:47.943 --> 14:49.532
The inside is not yet cooked.

14:49.533 --> 14:50.933
Roast a little longer.

14:52.413 --> 14:53.503
Eat peanuts.

14:55.343 --> 14:56.343
Damai,

14:56.653 --> 14:57.373
come and sit with us.

14:57.373 --> 14:58.373
Sure.

14:58.533 --> 15:00.423
What smells so good?

15:00.703 --> 15:01.703
We're roasting chestnuts.

15:03.533 --> 15:04.612
Is Nana asleep?

15:04.613 --> 15:05.613
Yes.

15:06.893 --> 15:09.023
We had no idea about what happened to Nana.

15:09.253 --> 15:10.942
If Damai hadn't called and told us

15:10.943 --> 15:12.372
to take care of her emotions,

15:12.373 --> 15:13.582
I guess we might not know what happened to her

15:13.583 --> 15:15.102
even if she had left.

15:15.103 --> 15:17.372
Nana came here because of this.

15:17.373 --> 15:19.222
It's impossible for her to tell us about it.

15:19.223 --> 15:20.942
But she should have told us.

15:20.943 --> 15:22.982
What if we could help her?

15:22.983 --> 15:24.213
How?

15:27.583 --> 15:29.903
But at least we can give her some care.

15:31.613 --> 15:33.182
I searched for the incident online.

15:33.183 --> 15:35.062
They exposed all of her personal information

15:35.063 --> 15:37.342
such as her address and
phone number online completely.

15:37.343 --> 15:38.503
It's indeed terrifying.

15:38.983 --> 15:40.423
This bunch of people

15:40.653 --> 15:43.573
should be arrested by the
police and sentenced to prison.

15:46.413 --> 15:47.413
Damai,

15:48.303 --> 15:49.693
when did you learn about it?

15:51.533 --> 15:53.702
The day you celebrated my birthday for me.

15:53.703 --> 15:56.302
Just at the bar of Hu's friend.

15:56.303 --> 15:58.853
Are you Singer Nana?

15:59.413 --> 16:00.102
No, I'm not.

16:00.103 --> 16:01.183
You've got the wrong person.

16:02.183 --> 16:03.732
Sorry.

16:03.733 --> 16:04.733
Nothing.

16:06.223 --> 16:09.023
I googled Singer Nana as soon as I was back.

16:10.343 --> 16:11.693
Then I found it out.

16:35.823 --> 16:37.573
What is that look?

16:47.703 --> 16:49.532
Isn't her Singer Nana?

16:49.533 --> 16:50.533
Right?

16:50.653 --> 16:51.772
The one who was accused of donation fraud?

16:51.773 --> 16:52.183
Yes.

16:52.183 --> 16:52.613
That's right.

16:52.614 --> 16:53.772
It's her.

16:53.773 --> 16:54.342
That's right.

16:54.343 --> 16:55.652
She's the streamer
who was accused of donation fraud.

16:55.653 --> 16:57.182
You're the streamer
who was accused of donation fraud.

16:57.183 --> 16:58.822
It's her!

16:58.823 --> 16:59.742
Why hasn't a person like her been banned?

16:59.743 --> 17:00.373
Confess your sin!

17:00.374 --> 17:01.542
You look exactly like a crook.

17:01.543 --> 17:03.383
Why the hell did you defraud
us in the name of charity?

17:10.303 --> 17:11.493
No, I didn't.

17:48.453 --> 17:49.063
Found her!

17:49.063 --> 17:49.503
It's her!

17:49.504 --> 17:50.452
She's that liar.

17:50.453 --> 17:51.773
You're a crook.

17:52.213 --> 17:53.493
How could you lie?

17:53.783 --> 17:54.783
It's her!

17:57.213 --> 17:58.733
Hurry up! She's the crook!

18:25.063 --> 18:26.253
Cuo Bazi!

18:27.933 --> 18:28.973
Cuo Bazi!

18:30.543 --> 18:31.543
Come!

18:31.743 --> 18:32.773
It's fine.

18:33.023 --> 18:34.823
Just let it sleep here.

18:35.503 --> 18:37.183
Did it wake you up?

18:37.863 --> 18:38.863
No.

18:39.893 --> 18:41.493
I had a dream just now.

18:43.823 --> 18:45.183
Want some water?

18:58.063 --> 18:59.063
Here.

19:00.893 --> 19:01.893
Thanks.

19:10.543 --> 19:11.773
Feeling better?

19:14.413 --> 19:16.013
Why are you still up?

19:16.213 --> 19:17.973
I'm writing the chapters
that need to be updated.

19:18.783 --> 19:20.623
What was the dream?

19:25.543 --> 19:26.863
I just had

19:29.103 --> 19:30.623
a nightmare.

19:33.303 --> 19:35.253
I was surrounded

19:35.693 --> 19:36.863
by a big crowd.

19:43.173 --> 19:45.062
It's just a bad dream.

19:45.063 --> 19:46.502
It's not true.

19:46.503 --> 19:48.253
Stop thinking about it.

19:49.863 --> 19:50.862
Just sleep.

19:50.863 --> 19:53.143
I'll let Cuo Bazi stay with you

19:53.503 --> 19:54.823
and keep you company.

19:56.103 --> 19:56.972
It's fine.

19:56.973 --> 19:58.143
I'm here, too.

20:00.173 --> 20:01.452
Go back to sleep.

20:01.453 --> 20:03.773
You stay here and keep her company.

20:49.653 --> 20:52.493
We're here so soon.

20:53.693 --> 20:55.013
I'll pick you up after work.

20:57.263 --> 20:58.263
Give me a kiss.

21:03.543 --> 21:05.103
That's enough!

21:09.173 --> 21:10.173
Go.

21:12.373 --> 21:13.212
See you.

21:13.213 --> 21:14.213
Bye.

21:20.063 --> 21:21.493
It's a nice day today.

21:22.063 --> 21:24.102
Thank god you're here.

21:24.103 --> 21:25.412
How's the construction going?

21:25.413 --> 21:26.973
I just came from the construction site.

21:27.373 --> 21:29.412
Well done, boss.

21:29.413 --> 21:29.893
It's nothing.

21:29.894 --> 21:32.342
We women are always
faithful to friends.

21:32.343 --> 21:33.343
Aren't we?

21:33.653 --> 21:34.653
By the way?

21:35.613 --> 21:36.862
How's Nana?

21:36.863 --> 21:37.413
She's okay.

21:37.414 --> 21:39.212
Damai is with her.

21:39.213 --> 21:40.533
Is Damai back?

21:42.653 --> 21:43.693
That's good.

21:44.023 --> 21:46.213
I didn't sleep well last night.

21:47.173 --> 21:48.173
Why?

21:51.173 --> 21:52.132
Look.

21:52.133 --> 21:52.862
What is this?

21:52.863 --> 21:53.973
Text messages.

21:56.423 --> 21:59.196
[Are you the manager?
How can you hire someone like that?]

22:01.736 --> 22:04.869
[I'm Nana's fan. She's a kind girl.
Hope she can live a good life.]

22:10.583 --> 22:13.976
[Why hasn't that Nana been fired?
I'm sick of seeing her again.]

22:14.213 --> 22:16.663
What they said was indeed harsh.

22:18.213 --> 22:19.972
There was a lot of encouragement as well.

22:19.973 --> 22:20.693
Really.

22:20.694 --> 22:22.082
I didn't dare read the rest.

22:22.083 --> 22:25.296
[I know this cafe because of Nana.
I love her voice and your cafe.]

22:26.503 --> 22:29.343
Excuse me, I wonder if Nana is coming today?

22:29.863 --> 22:30.303
Who are you?

22:30.304 --> 22:31.132
Why do you want to see her?

22:31.133 --> 22:33.342
I'm a reporter of the program
called Imperfect Human.

22:33.343 --> 22:34.863
I want to interview Singer Nana.

22:37.613 --> 22:39.212
We're a talk show.

22:39.213 --> 22:40.612
Have you watched our show before?

22:40.613 --> 22:41.623
Nope.

22:42.063 --> 22:43.652
Well,
let me introduce our program to you a little bit.

22:43.653 --> 22:45.623
Mr. Xu, we're kinda busy.

22:45.863 --> 22:46.543
How about this?

22:46.544 --> 22:48.612
Could you give me Nana's
phone number or something?

22:48.613 --> 22:50.103
I'll contact her directly.

22:50.613 --> 22:52.022
I'm afraid I can't.

22:52.023 --> 22:53.212
How about this?

22:53.213 --> 22:54.652
I'll tell Nana about this.

22:54.653 --> 22:57.022
Let her decide whether
she wants to do the interview.

22:57.023 --> 22:59.652
I'll let her contact you if she wants to.

22:59.653 --> 23:00.652
Okay. That's fine.

23:00.653 --> 23:01.303
Please call me if she agrees.

23:01.304 --> 23:02.542
Sure. Where do you sit?

23:02.543 --> 23:03.543
Over there.

23:04.743 --> 23:05.543
Please wait a moment.

23:05.544 --> 23:06.452
Your order will be ready soon.

23:06.453 --> 23:07.452
Okay. Thank you.

23:07.453 --> 23:08.623
You're welcome Okay.

23:11.613 --> 23:14.172
He's like a fly that never
stops chasing the trail of blood.

23:14.173 --> 23:15.062
He only knows to gorge on others' misery.

23:15.063 --> 23:16.383
Don't give a damn about him.

23:17.413 --> 23:19.103
He's still a customer.

23:19.373 --> 23:20.932
Now that he likes to gorge on things,

23:20.933 --> 23:22.693
and there's plenty to eat in our restaurant,

23:22.893 --> 23:23.973
let's make him stuffed.

23:31.343 --> 23:33.172
Dear friends, hello.

23:33.173 --> 23:34.652
This time we're here at

23:34.653 --> 23:35.692
the famous Artisan Woodcarving Workshop,

23:35.693 --> 23:36.932
a wood-craving art museum.

23:36.933 --> 23:40.502
Behind me is the famous
wood carving craftsman Xiaxia.

23:40.503 --> 23:41.692
This time, we will not only take you

23:41.693 --> 23:43.932
to see the wood carving
skills but also take you to...

23:43.933 --> 23:44.782
The live streaming is over.

23:44.783 --> 23:45.543
I'm going to have lunch. Bye.

23:45.544 --> 23:47.302
Of our wood carving crafts.

23:47.303 --> 23:49.742
Please give us a like and subscribe down below.

23:49.743 --> 23:51.132
All right, let's go to the left side.

23:51.133 --> 23:52.892
Come on. Let me show you the room over there.

23:52.893 --> 23:54.013
I gotta go, Ying.

23:54.743 --> 23:55.542
Why?

23:55.543 --> 23:57.063
You're not feeling well?

23:59.023 --> 24:00.103
This way.

24:20.263 --> 24:21.493
Coffee?

24:23.023 --> 24:24.383
Would you like ice?

24:24.893 --> 24:25.893
More ice, please.

24:26.743 --> 24:28.103
Cuo Bazi, come back!

24:30.263 --> 24:33.022
Xiaxia, why are you here?

24:33.023 --> 24:34.623
I saw you didn't go to work.

24:35.893 --> 24:37.453
I took a few days off.

24:37.893 --> 24:40.143
This is Damai's dog, called Cuo Bazi.

24:40.453 --> 24:41.933
What dose "Cuo Bazi" mean?

24:42.173 --> 24:43.062
Changsha's dialect.

24:43.063 --> 24:44.623
It means liar.

24:45.373 --> 24:46.933
I'll make coffee.

25:06.693 --> 25:09.213
Now you know what I used to do.

25:12.023 --> 25:14.453
You didn't expect me to be so famous, did you?

25:20.453 --> 25:24.022
It's very nice of you to
come around and care for me.

25:24.023 --> 25:25.693
I know my care for you before is worthy.

25:28.453 --> 25:30.102
But I'm fine now.

25:30.103 --> 25:31.103
You may rest assured.

25:33.783 --> 25:35.183
How could you be fine?

25:36.133 --> 25:38.453
It's indeed scary even to me.

25:41.023 --> 25:42.213
A little.

25:43.613 --> 25:45.013
But it's all right now.

25:51.973 --> 25:53.343
Are you leaving soon?

25:54.823 --> 25:57.343
I planned to go back to
Shanghai to stay with my parents.

25:57.783 --> 26:00.453
I had bought the ticket,
but Damai came back suddenly.

26:03.103 --> 26:03.863
So if you had left two days ago,

26:03.864 --> 26:06.423
you wouldn't come back, would you?

26:11.503 --> 26:12.693
Perhaps.

26:14.343 --> 26:15.663
I don't know,

26:16.653 --> 26:18.863
But I will still invest
in the homsstay as usual.

26:22.783 --> 26:23.973
Where do you want to go?

26:29.973 --> 26:31.693
No idea.

26:32.783 --> 26:35.612
Just like I never thought

26:35.613 --> 26:37.103
I would stay in Yunnan for so long.

26:41.893 --> 26:43.143
Do you still remember

26:43.373 --> 26:45.183
the day I first came to Yunnan.

26:46.653 --> 26:47.653
Yes.

26:49.693 --> 26:52.493
At that time, I was at my lowest.

26:53.413 --> 26:55.663
I didn't know where I was supposed to be going.

26:56.973 --> 26:59.063
I ran out alone to start my road trip,

27:00.023 --> 27:01.293
thinking to myself

27:01.693 --> 27:03.583
that I would drive ceaselessly ahead

27:04.453 --> 27:06.183
to see

27:06.823 --> 27:08.863
where the road can take me to.

27:39.693 --> 27:41.102
Excuse me, sir.

27:41.103 --> 27:42.892
Would you please do me a favor?

27:42.893 --> 27:43.692
Sure.

27:43.693 --> 27:44.822
When I was reversing my car just now,

27:44.823 --> 27:45.932
the wheel got stuck in the pit.

27:45.933 --> 27:47.612
Could you help me push it out?

27:47.613 --> 27:48.479
No problem.

27:48.503 --> 27:49.503
Thanks.

27:54.543 --> 27:55.543
Here.

27:57.133 --> 27:58.183
Wait a second.

28:12.933 --> 28:13.503
Get in the car.

28:13.504 --> 28:14.502
Close the roof up.

28:14.503 --> 28:15.503
Okay.

28:28.343 --> 28:29.383
Now's the time.

28:30.783 --> 28:33.013
Three, two, one. Press the accelerator.

28:38.653 --> 28:39.023
Stop!

28:39.024 --> 28:40.493
Wait.

28:43.973 --> 28:45.103
Try again.

28:45.933 --> 28:47.583
Three, two, one. Press the accelerator.

28:56.413 --> 28:57.103
Thank you so much.

28:57.104 --> 28:58.583
You just saved my day.

28:58.783 --> 28:59.783
Don't mention it.

29:01.743 --> 29:04.102
Sorry about all the dirt on you.

29:04.103 --> 29:04.862
I'm fine. Don't worry.

29:04.863 --> 29:06.213
I'll change my clothes when I go back.

29:06.823 --> 29:08.063
Scrub off the dirt a little bit.

29:09.933 --> 29:10.933
Here.

29:11.413 --> 29:12.102
Take it.

29:12.103 --> 29:13.103
Thanks.

29:17.503 --> 29:17.863
Thank you.

29:17.864 --> 29:19.372
I'm truly sorry.

29:19.373 --> 29:20.493
I'm fine.

29:22.893 --> 29:24.862
Well, I... I gotta go.

29:24.863 --> 29:25.839
See you.

29:25.863 --> 29:26.863
Sir,

29:26.933 --> 29:29.103
I wonder if there is a restaurant nearby.

29:29.653 --> 29:30.933
There's one in the village ahead.

29:31.543 --> 29:32.612
Could you show me the way?

29:32.613 --> 29:34.063
I'd like to invite you to lunch.

29:35.063 --> 29:37.143
I can show you the way,
but lunch is not necessary.

29:38.373 --> 29:39.373
Xiaxia.

29:40.023 --> 29:40.373
Sister.

29:40.374 --> 29:41.533
What happened?

29:42.303 --> 29:43.262
Her car got stuck in the pit.

29:43.263 --> 29:44.423
I just helped her get it out.

29:44.653 --> 29:45.823
- Hello.
- Hello.

29:46.543 --> 29:48.022
Sister, she wants to have lunch.

29:48.023 --> 29:49.452
Take her to Galsang Flower Restaurant.

29:49.453 --> 29:50.102
Okay.

29:50.103 --> 29:51.822
Then you ride the bike
home and give me the helmet.

29:51.823 --> 29:52.823
Sure.

29:57.173 --> 29:58.132
See you.

29:58.133 --> 29:59.133
See you, sir.

29:59.453 --> 29:59.973
Thanks.

29:59.973 --> 30:00.973
It's nothing.

30:01.103 --> 30:02.823
Are you here for traveling
around the Erhai Lake?

30:03.213 --> 30:04.213
Yes.

30:04.453 --> 30:05.372
How did you get here?

30:05.373 --> 30:06.692
Something wrong with the GPS?

30:06.693 --> 30:07.822
I didn't use the GPS.

30:07.823 --> 30:10.102
I was thinking I'll drive as
long as there's a road ahead

30:10.103 --> 30:11.383
no matter where it leads me to.

30:12.453 --> 30:12.823
What do you think?

30:12.824 --> 30:14.183
Isn't here beautiful?

30:14.933 --> 30:16.262
Yes. The environment is nice.

30:16.263 --> 30:17.293
And there are not many people.

30:17.543 --> 30:18.543
It's gorgeous.

30:18.743 --> 30:19.743
Follow me.

30:31.693 --> 30:33.663
Life is really magical.

30:34.783 --> 30:37.183
If my wheel hadn't stuck in the pit,

30:37.453 --> 30:39.533
I wouldn't have met you and Xiaochun,

30:39.933 --> 30:41.493
I wouldn't have stayed here,

30:42.693 --> 30:44.253
and I wouldn't have

30:45.213 --> 30:47.693
had so many good friends.

30:51.613 --> 30:53.063
Then don't leave.

30:56.653 --> 30:58.823
At least don't leave like this.

31:01.453 --> 31:03.013
Don't leave like this?

31:07.263 --> 31:08.583
My mom said that

31:09.823 --> 31:11.253
one should never leave with hunger,

31:12.933 --> 31:14.253
should never leave with a grievance,

31:15.783 --> 31:16.973
and should never leave with tears.

31:21.863 --> 31:23.493
People who leave like this always suffer,

31:24.893 --> 31:26.933
so do those who fail to make them stay.

31:32.543 --> 31:35.822
If you want to leave,
you can wait until you are happy.

31:35.823 --> 31:40.723
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

31:43.243 --> 31:48.223
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

31:49.893 --> 31:50.893
Okay.

31:52.613 --> 31:53.623
Got it.

31:57.063 --> 31:58.493
If I'm leaving,

32:00.343 --> 32:01.733
I'm gonna leave happily.

32:05.063 --> 32:06.063
Yep.

32:06.303 --> 32:07.742
Then it's a deal.

32:07.743 --> 32:08.692
I gotta go.

32:08.693 --> 32:09.932
Have a cup of coffee before you go!

32:09.933 --> 32:10.933
No thanks.

32:11.413 --> 32:12.693
Xie Xiaoxia,

32:14.613 --> 32:15.892
You helped me.

32:15.893 --> 32:17.973
I said I'll buy you lunch but you said no.

32:18.743 --> 32:20.132
And this time you came over
to comfort me for so long.

32:20.133 --> 32:22.383
I said I'll buy you a cup of
coffee but you said no again.

32:23.823 --> 32:25.693
Why did you do all of this unconditionally?

32:27.693 --> 32:28.933
As long as you get better.

32:36.693 --> 32:37.892
That's it?

32:37.893 --> 32:39.383
Yep. That's it.

32:41.303 --> 32:47.443
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

32:49.443 --> 32:51.482
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

32:51.483 --> 32:55.603
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

32:56.053 --> 33:02.003
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

33:07.613 --> 33:08.613
Nana,

33:09.543 --> 33:10.973
what are you looking at?

33:11.213 --> 33:12.452
The clouds.

33:12.453 --> 33:14.103
The clouds are so beautiful today.

33:14.693 --> 33:16.022
It was the same yesterday.

33:16.023 --> 33:17.023
Was it?

33:17.613 --> 33:18.782
Is the coffee ready?

33:18.783 --> 33:20.102
The water boiled accidentally.

33:20.103 --> 33:21.823
We have to wait for
the temperature to drop first.

33:22.613 --> 33:23.823
Xiaxia came just now,

33:24.063 --> 33:25.063
Xiaxia?

33:28.303 --> 33:29.303
Go!

33:31.693 --> 33:32.172
Over there!

33:32.173 --> 33:34.782
Of course, it's good to do business, sir.

33:34.783 --> 33:36.302
It is just an accidental event

33:36.303 --> 33:38.172
that we have so many
tourists here all of a sudden.

33:38.173 --> 33:41.062
It won't always have as
many visitors as people think.

33:41.063 --> 33:43.502
As you just said, you wanna take out a loan

33:43.503 --> 33:44.932
for a commercial vehicle to carry passengers.

33:44.933 --> 33:46.583
This is really risky, to be honest.

33:47.263 --> 33:50.412
Why can't I do it if others can?

33:50.413 --> 33:53.293
Is your home located at that crossroad?

33:53.613 --> 33:54.892
You can simply put fruits

33:54.893 --> 33:57.692
and tie-dyed tablecloths at the door.

33:57.693 --> 33:59.612
It won't take up much of your time.

33:59.613 --> 34:01.782
You can even attach a QR code to your door

34:01.783 --> 34:03.412
so that people can pay with their mobile phone

34:03.413 --> 34:06.063
by themselves after you price your goods.

34:07.533 --> 34:08.702
Okay.

34:08.703 --> 34:09.822
No problem.

34:09.823 --> 34:12.532
I'll ask for you if the homestay is hiring.

34:12.533 --> 34:13.372
Thanks.

34:13.373 --> 34:15.213
So what are you good at?

34:15.823 --> 34:16.823
Cooking?

34:16.973 --> 34:18.052
Cleaning?

34:18.053 --> 34:19.372
I can do all of it.

34:19.373 --> 34:20.413
Okay. I see.

34:21.053 --> 34:23.742
Don't just look at Yao's outward success.

34:23.743 --> 34:25.182
You need to be aware of his huge investment.

34:25.183 --> 34:26.532
These years, he hasn't earned back

34:26.533 --> 34:27.782
the money he invested yet.

34:27.783 --> 34:29.012
If you really want to do business,

34:29.013 --> 34:31.182
rent a small store as the rent in our town

34:31.183 --> 34:32.532
is still relatively low.

34:32.533 --> 34:34.293
It is hard to start a big business.

34:36.093 --> 34:36.863
Thanks. I'll let you crack on.

34:36.863 --> 34:37.622
Gotta go.

34:37.623 --> 34:38.262
Okay.

34:38.263 --> 34:39.263
See you.

34:45.343 --> 34:46.343
Hey, bro.

34:46.743 --> 34:47.743
Yao.

34:47.973 --> 34:48.973
Huang.

34:49.663 --> 34:50.733
Why are you here?

34:50.973 --> 34:52.742
I come over to ask the secretary something.

34:52.743 --> 34:53.773
What are doing?

34:54.703 --> 34:57.213
I just met with at
least a dozen people

34:57.663 --> 34:58.702
who wanna do business.

34:58.703 --> 35:00.543
I listened to their plans one by one.

35:00.893 --> 35:02.052
Being hawkers or street sellers
who ply their own trade

35:02.053 --> 35:03.262
is kinda good.

35:03.263 --> 35:05.342
But some of them are so overambitious

35:05.343 --> 35:07.662
that they have to engage
in tourism industrial chain

35:07.663 --> 35:09.733
when they have no idea
what industrial chain is.

35:11.493 --> 35:12.302
We can't help.

35:12.303 --> 35:14.262
Some people haven't
got the ability to take risks.

35:14.263 --> 35:15.693
They have no risk awareness as well.

35:15.973 --> 35:17.663
I talked till my jaws ached.

35:18.143 --> 35:19.822
And there are more people coming this afternoon.

35:19.823 --> 35:21.742
But luckily the village director
will come in the afternoon.

35:21.743 --> 35:23.413
He's gonna back me up.

35:23.623 --> 35:24.623
Huang.

35:24.933 --> 35:25.933
Huang.

35:26.933 --> 35:28.052
Uncle Deqing?

35:28.053 --> 35:29.183
Uncle Deqing,

35:29.373 --> 35:30.943
What's wrong with your eye?

35:31.703 --> 35:32.622
Hello, Yao.

35:32.623 --> 35:34.623
I hit the door.

35:35.303 --> 35:36.623
It looks serious.

35:37.223 --> 35:38.333
Let's not talk about it anymore.

35:38.783 --> 35:41.253
Huang, don't worry about the old family house.

35:41.493 --> 35:43.063
What did Grandpa Yang say?

35:43.263 --> 35:44.622
We have almost persuaded him.

35:44.623 --> 35:45.492
But a bunch of people

35:45.493 --> 35:46.702
came to the old family house last week.

35:46.703 --> 35:47.892
Later he went back on what he had said.

35:47.893 --> 35:50.702
Old people like him are
too old to think straight.

35:50.703 --> 35:52.742
However,
don't worry about it too much.

35:52.743 --> 35:54.092
It's a done deal.

35:54.093 --> 35:55.733
We will certainly support
the cause of the village.

35:57.223 --> 35:58.733
Since there's nothing else, I should go.

35:59.053 --> 35:59.892
No problem.

35:59.893 --> 36:01.103
See you.

36:07.013 --> 36:08.862
Do you know who did this to his eye?

36:08.863 --> 36:09.972
Who?

36:09.973 --> 36:11.892
I met Auntie Gui in the morning.

36:11.893 --> 36:14.983
She told me that his eye
was hit by Grandpa Yang

36:15.413 --> 36:17.293
with a water pipe.

36:22.783 --> 36:23.783
Hongdou,

36:24.453 --> 36:26.342
is it true that Nana earned a lot

36:26.343 --> 36:27.413
when she was doing live streaming?

36:28.303 --> 36:29.463
I don't know.

36:29.893 --> 36:31.702
I heard online that Nana's dress costs

36:31.703 --> 36:33.142
more than 20,000 yuan.

36:33.143 --> 36:35.622
Who would spend more than
20,000 yuan to buy a dress.

36:35.623 --> 36:36.983
She must be very rich.

36:38.743 --> 36:40.092
Put away the paper towels.

36:40.093 --> 36:41.452
It's definitely going to rain tonight.

36:41.453 --> 36:42.453
Okay.

36:44.973 --> 36:47.662
I also heard online that
Nana dated a lot of boys

36:47.663 --> 36:49.213
when she was in school.

36:51.783 --> 36:52.892
I don't believe it.

36:52.893 --> 36:54.333
It's all nonsense.

36:54.863 --> 36:56.463
Then you shouldn't say that either.

36:56.663 --> 36:57.303
I understand.

36:57.304 --> 36:59.023
I'll never gossip about it.

37:01.743 --> 37:04.492
But anyway, Nana shouldn't take it seriously.

37:04.493 --> 37:06.052
Just don't take it personally.

37:06.053 --> 37:07.222
Don't give a damn about what others say.

37:07.223 --> 37:08.452
A clean hand wants no washing.

37:08.453 --> 37:09.932
What she needs is a strong mind.

37:09.933 --> 37:12.782
Call the police and sue
them without hesitation.

37:12.783 --> 37:15.222
Since you're not the one going through this,

37:15.223 --> 37:16.943
you don't have to worry.

37:18.663 --> 37:20.983
Not everyone has a strong mental grip.

37:22.013 --> 37:24.892
Do not use your own
imagination to easily evaluate

37:24.893 --> 37:26.503
the life that others experienced.

37:28.373 --> 37:30.532
Hongdou, don't scold me.

37:30.533 --> 37:32.012
I didn't say anything.

37:32.013 --> 37:33.253
I didn't scold you.

37:34.183 --> 37:35.662
Aren't you going to
have a barbecue with friends?

37:35.663 --> 37:36.622
You may go now.

37:36.623 --> 37:37.623
May I?

37:39.823 --> 37:40.373
It's fine.

37:40.373 --> 37:40.893
Leave it there.

37:40.893 --> 37:41.943
I'll clean it up.

37:42.223 --> 37:42.743
Go see your friends.

37:42.743 --> 37:43.372
Leave it to me.

37:43.373 --> 37:44.583
Thank you, Hongdou.

37:53.893 --> 37:55.213
Why are you crouching down?

37:58.453 --> 37:59.262
The glass is broken.

37:59.263 --> 38:00.263
I need to pick up the pieces.

38:00.533 --> 38:01.533
Get up.

38:01.703 --> 38:02.943
Don't cut your hand.

38:03.663 --> 38:04.183
Get up.

38:04.184 --> 38:05.663
I don't want to get up, I'm tired.

38:05.893 --> 38:07.253
Come on.

38:13.013 --> 38:14.013
Tired?

38:45.623 --> 38:49.063
It seems that my sweetheart is in a bad mood.

38:51.343 --> 38:53.293
Don't imitate how my parents talk.

38:54.343 --> 38:56.012
I saw the video you sent me.

38:56.013 --> 38:57.013
Your dad was like

38:57.533 --> 38:58.412
"Dou.

38:58.413 --> 38:59.092
Dou.

38:59.093 --> 39:00.463
What are you doing, Dou?"

39:01.183 --> 39:02.622
I hate you.

39:02.623 --> 39:03.623
I'll stop.

39:04.343 --> 39:05.693
Why are you so upset?

39:06.413 --> 39:07.413
Too tired?

39:08.493 --> 39:10.742
Today, I somehow received several phone calls

39:10.743 --> 39:12.373
looking for Nana.

39:12.823 --> 39:14.253
So I felt distressed.

39:15.703 --> 39:16.742
Then take the day off tomorrow.

39:16.743 --> 39:17.743
Give yourself a break.

39:18.343 --> 39:20.733
Xiaochun and Xin are
enough to take care of the store.

39:21.663 --> 39:23.143
I'm doing the work for Nana.

39:23.533 --> 39:24.143
It's fine.

39:24.144 --> 39:25.853
I'll come over tomorrow at noon.

39:26.053 --> 39:27.623
I'll leave if they're not busy.

39:29.343 --> 39:30.343
Come here.

39:46.623 --> 39:47.623
Done.

39:47.823 --> 39:49.622
Don't deceive yourself.

39:49.623 --> 39:50.742
Why can't I deceive myself

39:50.743 --> 39:51.943
as long as it can free you from annoying calls?

39:53.053 --> 39:54.143
I'm gonna take you somewhere.

39:54.893 --> 39:56.063
I haven't finished cleaning yet.

39:58.303 --> 39:59.303
Well,

40:01.183 --> 40:03.463
you sit here and watch, and I'll go clean it.

40:37.263 --> 40:39.023
Still thinking about Nana?

40:42.053 --> 40:43.943
Thinking about how to help her.

40:45.933 --> 40:47.623
You're already helping her,

40:48.373 --> 40:51.983
soothing her, covering her shift,
cooking for her

40:52.863 --> 40:54.143
although the taste is not that good.

40:57.223 --> 40:58.583
Not that good?

40:58.863 --> 40:59.983
Not that good?

41:00.863 --> 41:03.583
I even added sugar in the
fried eggs with tomatoes for her.

41:04.303 --> 41:06.773
Didn't you know that I
was trying to be humorous?

41:10.303 --> 41:12.143
Sometimes language doesn't work.

41:13.053 --> 41:14.053
Words like "keep going,"

41:14.263 --> 41:15.053
"we support you,"

41:15.054 --> 41:16.293
and "we got your back"

41:16.973 --> 41:18.253
can be easily said,

41:19.533 --> 41:21.253
but they sound powerless,

41:21.973 --> 41:22.973
right?

41:23.933 --> 41:25.412
As far as I'm concerned,

41:25.413 --> 41:28.543
it is our mutual hope
that Nana can get better.

41:29.353 --> 41:32.303
But we cannot be trapped and influenced by it.

41:33.193 --> 41:35.232
This is the problem that Nana needs to solve

41:35.233 --> 41:36.673
in her own life.

41:37.023 --> 41:38.312
The solution to the problem

41:38.313 --> 41:40.113
should be figured out on her own.

41:41.313 --> 41:43.113
Can't we help her figure it out?

41:45.983 --> 41:47.713
Actually, I've thought about it.

41:49.233 --> 41:51.713
But I'm afraid that
you'll hit me if I tell you.

41:53.313 --> 41:54.343
Tell me.

41:55.793 --> 41:57.593
You promise you will not hit me

41:57.793 --> 41:59.233
and will not be angry first.

42:00.063 --> 42:01.063
Just say it.

42:04.833 --> 42:06.463
I think we can do it in a practical way.

42:06.873 --> 42:08.062
We might as well

42:08.063 --> 42:10.033
encourage Nana to start live streaming again,

42:12.423 --> 42:13.982
facing the demon in her heart directly.

42:13.983 --> 42:16.272
In this way,
she'll get up from where she fell down,

42:16.273 --> 42:18.462
and it can also be
an advertisement for your B&B

42:18.463 --> 42:19.502
and you can sell your products

42:19.503 --> 42:20.672
and make money through live streaming.

42:20.673 --> 42:22.383
Just leverage her popularity.

42:23.713 --> 42:25.633
Are you out of your mind?

42:26.463 --> 42:27.513
Then,

42:28.313 --> 42:30.392
you can tell her what happened to your bestie,

42:30.393 --> 42:32.352
share with her what made you

42:32.353 --> 42:34.233
distressed and heart-broken, and encourage her

42:34.543 --> 42:36.033
to look upon life as a positive experience.

42:37.833 --> 42:39.022
Why?

42:39.023 --> 42:40.912
What's the look on your face?

42:40.913 --> 42:43.193
You make me feel like I'm a bottle of poison.

42:43.833 --> 42:44.792
She was so depressed

42:44.793 --> 42:46.463
but you still want her to do live streaming?

42:46.673 --> 42:48.193
Do you have any humanity left?

42:48.543 --> 42:51.352
My suggestion might sound harsh,

42:51.353 --> 42:53.593
but it's necessary for her
to break free from this prison.

42:54.023 --> 42:55.792
Break free from this prison.

42:55.793 --> 42:57.513
Step out of the comfort zone.

42:57.833 --> 42:59.192
Is that what you mean?

42:59.193 --> 43:01.553
I need to tell you that your idea is absurd.

43:01.793 --> 43:03.312
Step out of the comfort zone.

43:03.313 --> 43:04.912
She finally feels a sense of relief,

43:04.913 --> 43:05.673
but now you're gonna tell her that

43:05.674 --> 43:07.022
she should keep doing things
that make her struggle.

43:07.023 --> 43:08.193
Are you insane?

43:10.393 --> 43:12.263
I don't wanna talk about this with you anymore.

43:13.193 --> 43:14.232
It's dark here.

43:14.233 --> 43:15.383
Be careful.

43:18.193 --> 43:19.593
What are you laughing at?

43:21.193 --> 43:22.102
Let me help you.

43:22.103 --> 43:23.103
I got you.

43:23.503 --> 43:25.553
I'll break up with you for three days.

43:25.873 --> 43:26.873
Don't touch me.

43:27.673 --> 43:28.792
Sorry.

43:28.793 --> 43:29.672
My bad.

43:29.673 --> 43:30.872
I apologize.

43:30.873 --> 43:31.193
Hongdou.

43:31.194 --> 43:32.102
Leave me alone.

43:32.103 --> 43:33.103
Hongdou.

43:33.673 --> 43:34.673
Dou!

43:35.103 --> 43:36.193
Dou!

43:36.713 --> 43:37.542
Wait.

43:37.543 --> 43:38.462
My horse is still here.

43:38.463 --> 43:39.463
Just give me a second.

43:39.583 --> 43:40.712
Wait for me!

43:43.853 --> 43:49.373
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

43:51.293 --> 43:56.293
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:58.693 --> 44:04.813
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

